{"minVersion":"0.1","headerImage":"https://apt.mjh.im/assets/hongguofn.roothide/banner.png","tintColor":"#27BEF5","tabs":[{"tabname":"详情 Details","views":[{"class":"HiddenDepictionScreenshotsView","screenshots":[],"itemCornerRadius":8,"itemSize":false},{"markdown":"# 红果净化\n\n红果短剧专用 iOS 越狱插件，适配红果短剧 7.3.9。\n\n- 按需隐藏金币挂件、弹幕入口、作者声明、系列剧入口、爆剧标志、榜单、热评、剧标签及 AI 标识与备案号。\n- 顶部与底部导航多选隐藏，默认启动页与首页频道单选。\n- 短剧广告控制、播放时长显示、关闭进入自动播放与 App 内原生本地下载。\n- 个人中心整组快捷入口隐藏、可选会员状态卡片。\n- 原生二级设置与插件总开关。入口：我的 → 设置 → 红果净化，位于“清理缓存”上方。\n\n- 红点提醒与侧边栏游戏中心独立控制，支持通知权限伪装。\n- 长按倍速支持滑块和步进器，范围 0.5～3.0、每步 0.05；可自动按配置倍速播放。\n- 支持清晰度锁定、自动清屏及暂停时退出清屏。\n\n官网：https://hongguo.goforit.si\n\n会员状态为本地显示，账号权益以实际账号为准。\n","useSpacing":"true","class":"DepictionMarkdownView"},{"class":"DepictionHeaderView","title":"插件信息 Info"},{"class":"DepictionTableTextView","title":"开发者 Developer","text":"Junhong"},{"class":"DepictionTableTextView","title":"版本 Version","text":"1.0.1"},{"class":"DepictionTableTextView","title":"兼容性 Compatibility","text":"15.0 至 17.0"},{"class":"DepictionTableTextView","title":"分类 Section","text":"Tweaks"},{"class":"DepictionSpacerView"},{"class":"DepictionTableButtonView","title":"项目主页 Homepage","action":"https://hongguo.goforit.si/","openExternal":"true","tintColor":"#27BEF5"},{"class":"DepictionSpacerView"},{"class":"DepictionTableButtonView","title":"联系支持 Contact Support","action":"depiction-https://apt.mjh.im/depiction/native/help/hongguofn.roothide.json","openExternal":"true","tintColor":"#27BEF5"},{"class":"DepictionLabelView","text":"Junhong&#x27;s Repo · Updated ","textColor":"#999999","fontSize":"10.0","alignment":1}],"class":"DepictionStackView"},{"tabname":"更新日志 Changelog","views":[{"class":"DepictionMarkdownView","markdown":"#### 版本 1.0.1\n\n新增红点提醒净化与两侧栏游戏中心独立隐藏；恢复通知权限伪装；倍速滑块与步进器支持 0.5～3.0 倍、每步 0.05，可自动按配置倍速播放；新增清晰度锁定、自动清屏及暂停时退出清屏子开关。"},{"class":"DepictionMarkdownView","markdown":"#### 版本 1.0.0\n\n观看页面独立净化开关；顶部与底部导航多选隐藏；启动页及频道选择；时长显示、播放和本地下载控制；个人中心快捷区与会员状态显示。"},{"class":"DepictionLabelView","text":"Junhong&#x27;s Repo · Updated ","textColor":"#999999","fontSize":"10.0","alignment":1}],"class":"DepictionStackView"}],"class":"DepictionTabView"}